<section class="family-planner" id="family-planner" data-family-planner aria-labelledby="family-planner-title">
  <header class="family-hero">
    <div class="family-hero__copy">
      <span class="family-kicker"><span class="family-flag" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span> KOLEDAR365 · DRUŽINSKI TEDEN</span>
      <h2 id="family-planner-title">Vsi vaši načrti. En mirnejši teden.</h2>
      <p>Dogodki, opravila, obroki in nakupi na enem mestu. Družinski pregled ostane shranjen v tem brskalniku.</p>
      <div class="family-hero__actions">
        <button class="family-button family-button--primary" type="button" data-family-focus="family-event-title">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg> Dodaj načrt
        </button>
        <button class="family-button" type="button" data-family-print>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 8V3h10v5M7 17H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v5a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2M7 14h10v7H7z"/></svg> Natisni teden
        </button>
        <button class="family-button family-button--quiet" type="button" data-family-export-ics>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3v12m-5-5 5 5 5-5M5 17v4h14v-4"/></svg> Izvozi v koledar
        </button>
      </div>
      <p class="family-privacy"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 10V7a6 6 0 0 1 12 0v3m-13 0h14v11H5z"/><path d="M12 14v3"/></svg> Vaša družinska imena in zapisi ostanejo v tej napravi.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="family-hero__art" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 390 270" focusable="false">
        <defs>
          <linearGradient id="familyCard" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1"><stop stop-color="#fff"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#edf4fb"/></linearGradient>
          <filter id="familyShadow" x="-20%" y="-20%" width="140%" height="150%"><feDropShadow dx="0" dy="13" stdDeviation="13" flood-color="#15385d" flood-opacity=".16"/></filter>
        </defs>
        <circle cx="313" cy="58" r="48" fill="#fff" opacity=".48"/><circle cx="62" cy="215" r="36" fill="#f7cfd5" opacity=".52"/>
        <g filter="url(#familyShadow)" transform="rotate(-4 194 133)">
          <rect x="68" y="28" width="246" height="213" rx="22" fill="url(#familyCard)" stroke="#d8e4ef"/>
          <path d="M68 50a22 22 0 0 1 22-22h202a22 22 0 0 1 22 22v40H68z" fill="#075da4"/>
          <path d="M68 77h246v13H68z" fill="#b92f45"/>
          <path d="M124 17v25m133-25v25" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="8" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          <text x="91" y="63" fill="#fff" font-size="12" font-family="system-ui,sans-serif" font-weight="750" letter-spacing="1.2">NAŠ TEDEN</text>
          <g fill="#6a7c91" font-size="10" font-family="system-ui,sans-serif" text-anchor="middle"><text x="105" y="116">PON</text><text x="151" y="116">TOR</text><text x="197" y="116">SRE</text><text x="243" y="116">ČET</text><text x="289" y="116">PET</text></g>
          <g fill="#e7eef6"><rect x="86" y="128" width="39" height="35" rx="9"/><rect x="132" y="128" width="39" height="35" rx="9"/><rect x="178" y="128" width="39" height="35" rx="9"/><rect x="224" y="128" width="39" height="35" rx="9"/><rect x="270" y="128" width="39" height="35" rx="9"/><rect x="86" y="170" width="39" height="35" rx="9"/><rect x="132" y="170" width="39" height="35" rx="9"/><rect x="178" y="170" width="39" height="35" rx="9"/><rect x="224" y="170" width="39" height="35" rx="9"/><rect x="270" y="170" width="39" height="35" rx="9"/></g>
          <rect x="132" y="128" width="39" height="35" rx="9" fill="#f7dfe3"/><rect x="224" y="170" width="39" height="35" rx="9" fill="#dbeaf7"/>
          <g fill="#425a73" font-size="12" font-family="system-ui,sans-serif" text-anchor="middle"><text x="105" y="151">20</text><text x="151" y="151">21</text><text x="197" y="151">22</text><text x="243" y="151">23</text><text x="289" y="151">24</text><text x="105" y="193">27</text><text x="151" y="193">28</text><text x="197" y="193">29</text><text x="243" y="193">30</text><text x="289" y="193">31</text></g>
          <circle cx="151" cy="158" r="3" fill="#b92f45"/><circle cx="243" cy="200" r="3" fill="#075da4"/>
        </g>
        <rect x="267" y="188" width="100" height="52" rx="15" fill="#fff" stroke="#dce6ef"/><circle cx="290" cy="214" r="12" fill="#f6dfe3"/><path d="M286 214h8m-4-4v8" stroke="#b92f45" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/><text x="309" y="211" fill="#233b57" font-size="10" font-family="system-ui,sans-serif" font-weight="700">VEČERJA</text><text x="309" y="225" fill="#71839a" font-size="9" font-family="system-ui,sans-serif">skupaj doma</text>
      </svg>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="family-stats" aria-label="Pregled družinskega tedna">
    <article><span class="family-stat-icon family-stat-icon--blue"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 20v-1.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0-3.5-3.5h-5A3.5 3.5 0 0 0 4 18.5V20m6-9a4 4 0 1 0 0-8 4 4 0 0 0 0 8Zm7-5a3 3 0 0 1 0 6m3 8v-1.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0-2.5-3.35"/></svg></span><strong data-family-stat="members">0</strong><small>članov družine</small></article>
    <article><span class="family-stat-icon family-stat-icon--red"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="16" rx="3"/><path d="M16 3v4M8 3v4M3 10h18m-13 4h4m-4 3h8"/></svg></span><strong data-family-stat="plans">0</strong><small>načrtov ta teden</small></article>
    <article><span class="family-stat-icon family-stat-icon--blue"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 12 4 4L19 6"/></svg></span><strong data-family-stat="tasks">0 / 0</strong><small>opravljenih opravil</small></article>
    <article><span class="family-stat-icon family-stat-icon--red"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 5h16l-2 15H6L4 5Zm4 0 1-3h6l1 3M9 9v7m6-7v7"/></svg></span><strong data-family-stat="groceries">0</strong><small>na nakupovalnem seznamu</small></article>
  </div>

  <div class="family-week-layout">
    <section class="family-card family-week-card" id="family-week" aria-labelledby="family-week-title">
      <div class="family-card-heading family-week-heading">
        <div><span class="family-kicker">VSI NAČRTI NA ENEM POGLEDU</span><h3 id="family-week-title">Naš družinski teden</h3><p data-family-week-label aria-live="polite"></p></div>
        <div class="family-week-nav"><button type="button" data-family-prev-week aria-label="Prejšnji teden">‹</button><button type="button" data-family-this-week>Tekoči teden</button><button type="button" data-family-next-week aria-label="Naslednji teden">›</button></div>
      </div>
      <div class="family-week-grid" data-family-week aria-label="Tedenski pregled"></div>
      <div class="family-legend"><span><i class="family-dot family-dot--blue"></i>Dogodek</span><span><i class="family-dot family-dot--red"></i>Opravilo</span><span><i class="family-dot family-dot--meal"></i>Obrok</span></div>
    </section>

    <section class="family-card family-members-card" id="family-members" aria-labelledby="family-members-title">
      <div class="family-card-heading"><div><span class="family-kicker">NAČRTUJTE SKUPAJ</span><h3 id="family-members-title">Člani družine</h3></div><span class="family-card-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M16 20v-1.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0-3.5-3.5h-5A3.5 3.5 0 0 0 4 18.5V20m6-9a4 4 0 1 0 0-8 4 4 0 0 0 0 8Zm7-5a3 3 0 0 1 0 6m3 8v-1.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0-2.5-3.35"/></svg></span></div>
      <div class="family-members-list" data-family-members aria-live="polite"></div>
      <form class="family-inline-form" data-family-member-form>
        <label for="family-member-name">Dodajte ime</label>
        <div class="family-member-add"><input id="family-member-name" name="name" maxlength="40" placeholder="Na primer: Ana" required><select name="color" aria-label="Barva člana"><option value="blue">Modra</option><option value="red">Rdeča</option><option value="sky">Svetlo modra</option><option value="rose">Svetlo rdeča</option></select><button type="submit" aria-label="Dodaj člana">+</button></div>
        <small>Do 8 članov · barva pomaga hitro ločiti načrte.</small>
      </form>
      <output class="family-status" data-family-member-status role="status"></output>
    </section>
  </div>

  <div class="family-feature-grid">
    <section class="family-card family-agenda-card" id="family-agenda" aria-labelledby="family-agenda-title">
      <div class="family-card-heading"><div><span class="family-kicker">DOGODKI IN OPRAVILA</span><h3 id="family-agenda-title">Dodajte načrt</h3></div><span class="family-card-icon family-card-icon--red" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></span></div>
      <form class="family-form" data-family-event-form>
        <input type="hidden" name="id">
        <div class="family-form-row family-form-row--title"><label for="family-event-title">Kaj je na sporedu?<input id="family-event-title" name="title" maxlength="120" placeholder="Na primer: Nogometni trening" required></label></div>
        <div class="family-form-row"><label for="family-event-date">Datum<input id="family-event-date" name="date" type="date" required></label><label for="family-event-time">Ura<input id="family-event-time" name="time" type="time"></label><label for="family-event-end">Konec<input id="family-event-end" name="endTime" type="time"></label></div>
        <div class="family-form-row"><label for="family-event-kind">Vrsta<select id="family-event-kind" name="kind"><option value="event">Dogodek</option><option value="task">Opravilo</option><option value="chore">Domače opravilo</option></select></label><label for="family-event-member">Za koga?<select id="family-event-member" name="memberId"><option value="">Za vso družino</option></select></label></div>
        <div class="family-form-row"><label for="family-event-repeat">Ponavljanje<select id="family-event-repeat" name="repeat"><option value="none">Brez ponavljanja</option><option value="weekly">Vsak teden</option></select></label><label for="family-event-reminder">Opomnik ob izvozu<select id="family-event-reminder" name="reminder"><option value="0">Brez opomnika</option><option value="5">5 minut prej</option><option value="15">15 minut prej</option><option value="30">30 minut prej</option><option value="60">1 uro prej</option></select></label></div>
        <div class="family-form-actions"><button class="family-button family-button--primary" type="submit" data-family-event-submit>Shrani načrt</button><button class="family-button" type="button" data-family-event-cancel hidden>Prekliči</button></div>
      </form>
      <output class="family-status" data-family-event-status role="status"></output>
      <div class="family-agenda-list" data-family-agenda aria-live="polite"></div>
    </section>

    <section class="family-card family-meals-card" id="family-meals" aria-labelledby="family-meals-title">
      <div class="family-card-heading"><div><span class="family-kicker">MANJ UGIBANJA, VEČ SKUPNIH OBROKOV</span><h3 id="family-meals-title">Jedilnik za teden</h3></div><span class="family-card-icon family-card-icon--blue" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 3v8a4 4 0 0 0 8 0V3M8 3v7m0 0V3m8 18V3c3 2 4 5 4 9h-4"/></svg></span></div>
      <form class="family-form" data-family-meal-form>
        <input type="hidden" name="id">
        <div class="family-form-row"><label for="family-meal-date">Dan<input id="family-meal-date" name="date" type="date" required></label><label for="family-meal-title">Obrok<input id="family-meal-title" name="title" maxlength="100" placeholder="Na primer: Zelenjavna juha" required></label></div>
        <label for="family-meal-ingredients">Sestavine, ločene z vejico<textarea id="family-meal-ingredients" name="ingredients" maxlength="600" rows="2" placeholder="korenje, krompir, čebula"></textarea></label>
        <div class="family-form-actions"><button class="family-button family-button--primary" type="submit">Shrani obrok</button><button class="family-button" type="button" data-family-meal-cancel hidden>Prekliči</button></div>
      </form>
      <output class="family-status" data-family-meal-status role="status"></output>
      <div class="family-meals-list" data-family-meals-list aria-live="polite"></div>
    </section>

    <section class="family-card family-shopping-card" id="family-shopping" aria-labelledby="family-shopping-title">
      <div class="family-card-heading"><div><span class="family-kicker">NAKUPI BREZ PODVOJENIH LISTKOV</span><h3 id="family-shopping-title">Nakupovalni seznam</h3></div><span class="family-card-icon family-card-icon--red" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 5h16l-2 15H6L4 5Zm4 0 1-3h6l1 3"/></svg></span></div>
      <form class="family-form family-shopping-form" data-family-grocery-form>
        <label for="family-grocery-name">Kaj potrebujete?<input id="family-grocery-name" name="name" maxlength="100" placeholder="Dodajte izdelek" required></label>
        <div class="family-form-row"><label for="family-grocery-quantity">Količina<input id="family-grocery-quantity" name="quantity" maxlength="30" placeholder="npr. 2 kosa"></label><label for="family-grocery-category">Oddelek<select id="family-grocery-category" name="category"><option value="Ostalo">Ostalo</option><option value="Sadje in zelenjava">Sadje in zelenjava</option><option value="Mlečni izdelki">Mlečni izdelki</option><option value="Pekarna">Pekarna</option><option value="Shramba">Shramba</option></select></label></div>
        <button class="family-button family-button--primary" type="submit">Dodaj na seznam <span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button>
      </form>
      <div class="family-grocery-toolbar"><span data-family-grocery-count>0 izdelkov</span><button type="button" data-family-clear-groceries hidden>Odstrani kupljeno</button></div>
      <div class="family-grocery-list" data-family-groceries aria-live="polite"></div>
      <output class="family-status" data-family-grocery-status role="status"></output>
    </section>

    <section class="family-card family-next-card" aria-labelledby="family-next-title">
      <div class="family-card-heading"><div><span class="family-kicker">NAJPREJ PRED VAMI</span><h3 id="family-next-title">Naslednji načrt</h3></div><span class="family-card-icon family-card-icon--blue" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 7v5l3 2"/></svg></span></div>
      <div class="family-next-content" data-family-next></div>
    </section>
  </div>

  <section class="family-backup" aria-labelledby="family-backup-title">
    <div><span class="family-kicker">VAŠI PODATKI, VAŠ IZBOR</span><h3 id="family-backup-title">Varnostna kopija in koledar</h3><p>Načrte lahko prenesete kot iCalendar ali shranite v datoteko, ki jo lahko pozneje obnovite.</p></div>
    <div class="family-backup-actions"><button class="family-button" type="button" data-family-backup>Ustvari kopijo JSON</button><label class="family-import-button">Obnovi kopijo<input type="file" accept="application/json,.json" data-family-restore></label></div>
    <output class="family-status" data-family-backup-status role="status"></output>
  </section>
</section>
